		{
			dependencies: ["26061FA07E309955"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#3FC5D8 to=#C6F6FD f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>花园之石</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>周围有植物方块时，你就可以飞行。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>免疫饥饿、中毒和凋零效果。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你身上的所有效果持续时间更长。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>附近的作物生长更快，你的攻击会施加中毒和阻止治疗效果。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>主动技能会消耗经验值，治疗你周围的所有生物，冷却时间为 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>16秒</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!danger] 自然再生减缓，火焰和投射物造成的伤害更高。"
			]
			id: "243FCE35AD6A9C5F"
			min_width: 340
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#3FC5D8 to=#3FC5D8>飞吧，如果你带了足够的植物。</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "1156FE59E16EEA79"
				item: "enigmaticaddons:revival_leaf"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#3FC5D8 to=#C6F6FD f=0.6>复苏之叶</grad></shadow>"
			x: -1.0d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4C11F417CF8B98B3"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#3FC5D8 to=#C6F6FD f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>免费伤害</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>会自行向附近的生物投掷灵魂火球，每 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>3 秒一次</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你受到的伤害会分摊给周围的生物。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>普通的亡灵会完全无视你。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>50 percent</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 来自无视护甲的攻击造成的伤害减少。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!danger] 站在强光下会灼伤你，附近的植物会悄悄死亡，并且会受到25%更多的非魔法伤害。"
			]
			id: "575F195A181DD2C0"
			min_width: 340
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#3FC5D8 to=#3FC5D8>它会为你而战。悄无声息地。</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "41704B6F7C3EF0CE"
				item: "enigmaticaddons:illusion_lantern"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#3FC5D8 to=#C6F6FD f=0.6>幻象灵魂灯笼</grad></shadow>"
			x: 1.0d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["12839E03F37B480A"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#3FC5D8 to=#C6F6FD f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>盔甲升级</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>消耗一套完整的以太套装、一个哥利亚之心和一个末影之杖，并以单个魔石返还大部分材料。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>+12 护甲</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 和 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>+10 韧性</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>50 百分比</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>击退抗性。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将所受伤害的 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>40%</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 转化为下一次攻击的额外伤害，上限为 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>25</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 点。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>免疫窒息、仙人掌伤害和爆炸。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你的护甲变为隐形。按 Shift 加右键可切换该状态。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>激活后，会在40秒的冷却时间内生成一个以太护盾。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "2E01BE1E79EACCCB"
			min_width: 350
			shape: "diamond"
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#3FC5D8 to=#3FC5D8>一整套以太套装，仅需一个格子。</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "1B4CBA92284C5B03"
				item: "enigmaticaddons:etherium_core"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#3FC5D8 to=#C6F6FD f=0.6>以太核心</grad></shadow>"
			x: -5.0d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: [
				"2E01BE1E79EACCCB"
				"4D379BDFB36EE388"
			]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#B06BE8 to=#E3C4FF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>前半部分</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>非欧几里得立方体在模组中没有配方。本整合包制作了一个，而这两块破损的碎片是其核心。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>两个部分都是整合包物品，所以模组自带的指南绝不会提到它们。</grad></shadow></shadow>"
			]
			id: "5870E7A9BE71686E"
			min_width: 320
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#B06BE8 to=#B06BE8>本不该存在之物的一半。</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "5E5F3C6E849A2B79"
				item: "linggango_tweaks:broken_cube_piece_1"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#C77DFF to=#F0DAFF f=0.6>破损的立方体碎片</grad></shadow>"
			x: -2.0d
			y: 5.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: [
				"575F195A181DD2C0"
				"243FCE35AD6A9C5F"
			]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#B06BE8 to=#E3C4FF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>后半部分</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>和第一块一样。先拿到这两块，然后看整合包要求你周围放什么。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "60B08362C4C3943C"
			min_width: 320
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#B06BE8 to=#B06BE8>另一半。</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "5219CBF7B72D1BD6"
				item: "linggango_tweaks:broken_cube_piece_2"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#C77DFF to=#F0DAFF f=0.6>破损的立方体碎片</grad></shadow>"
			x: 2.0d
			y: 5.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: [
				"5870E7A9BE71686E"
				"60B08362C4C3943C"
			]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#C77DFF to=#F0DAFF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>一切，同时发生</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>配方需要破碎立方体碎片、失落引擎、幻象灵魂灯笼、复苏树叶、暗影锭和黑暗锭。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#B06BE8 to=#E3C4FF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>被动生物</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>+35 percent</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 冲刺， </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>+100 percent</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 游泳， </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>+60 percent</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 采矿和 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>+40 percent</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 攻击速度。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>+1</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 财富与 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>+1</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 幸运。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>单次攻击伤害高于 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>100</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 将被完全抵消。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>35 百分率</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>的几率反弹任何攻击或投射物。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>近战攻击者会获得随机负面效果。每次击杀会给你一个随机正面效果。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>无需空气，免疫所有负面效果，免疫坠落、火焰、熔岩、窒息、传送和碰撞伤害。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>高于 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>1</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 生命值时，你能幸存任何伤害。低于或等于该值时，会触发传送，并将你的生命值恢复到带有增益效果的 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>30 百分比</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"[!danger] 除非你已在世界内至少80%的时间佩戴了七诅咒之戒，或99.5%的时间佩戴了七美德之戒，否则无法装备。过早制作它只会得到一个非常闪亮的镇纸。"
			]
			id: "450FAC40CF9056BE"
			min_width: 400
			shape: "star"
			size: 1.75d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#B06BE8 to=#B06BE8>游戏中最好的附魔石，而且它会检查你的ID。</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "6B8BBD1AB574DC97"
				item: "enigmaticlegacy:the_cube"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#C77DFF to=#F0DAFF f=0.6>非欧几里得立方体</grad></shadow>"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 6.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["450FAC40CF9056BE"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#FFD97A to=#FFFFFF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>永生不死</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>此整合包使用 Hellspec Alloy Blocks、Apocalyptium Ingots、Revelation 和非欧立方体本身来建造它。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>正在活跃的凋零头颅雨，冷却时间为 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>3秒</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>免疫窒息、坠落、碰撞、压力、饥饿、虚空、仙人掌、火焰和岩浆伤害。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>免疫几乎所有负面效果。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你可以飞行，不受挖掘惩罚的影响。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF8A8A to=#E03131 f=0.8>装备此物品或仅将其放在背包中，你都将获得永生。</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7></grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 最后一行没有夸张，也没有小字条款。这就是这个模组的终点。"
			]
			id: "7710237C57E438B6"
			min_width: 400
			shape: "star"
			size: 2.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#FFD97A to=#FFD97A>模组中的最后一个物品。</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "1B4E0669F6B091C3"
